## ActionType: Create Replenishment Alert

Creates a replenishment alert when a material falls below its safety stock.

### Bound Object

| Bound Object | Action Type |
| --- | --- |
| material | create |

### Trigger Condition

```yaml
condition:
  object_type_id: material
  field: current_stock
  operation: lt_field
  value: safety_stock
```

### Tool Configuration

| Type | Toolbox ID | Tool ID |
| --- | --- | --- |
| http | procurement | create_replenishment_alert |

### Parameter Binding

| Parameter | Source | Binding | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| sku | property | sku | Material code |
| current_stock | property | current_stock | Current inventory |
| safety_stock | property | safety_stock | Replenishment threshold |
